um for medical students. Prev Med. 2002;35:78&#x02013;86. <pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12079444</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="CR18"><label>18.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Lang</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>McCord</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Harvill</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Anderson</surname><given-names>DS</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Communication assessment using the common ground instrument: psychometric properties</article-title><source>Fam Med</source><year>2004</year><volume>36</volume><fpage>189</fpage><lpage>198</lpage></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Lang F, McCord R, Harvill L, Anderson DS. Communication assessment using the common ground instrument: psychometric properties. Fam Med. 2004;36:189&#x02013;98. <pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">14999576</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="CR19"><label>19.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Parish</surname><given-names>SJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Ramaswamy</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Stein</surname><given-names>MR</given-names></name><name><surname>Kachur</surname><given-names>EK</given-names></name><name><surname>Arnsten</surname><given-names>JH</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Teaching about substance abuse with objective structured clinical exams</article-title><source>J Gen Intern Med</source><year>2006</year><volume>21</volume><fpage>453</fpage><lpage>459</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1111/j.1525-1497.2006.00426.x</pub-id></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Parish SJ, Ramaswamy M, Stein MR, Kachur EK, Arnsten JH. Teaching about substance abuse with objective structured clinical exams. J Gen Intern Med. 2006;21:453&#x02013;9. <pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16704387</p