</name><name><surname>Frasier</surname><given-names>PY</given-names></name><name><surname>Strayhorn</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Kowlowitz</surname><given-names>V</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Prevention practices of family medicine clerkship preceptors in North Carolina</article-title><source>Acad Med</source><year>2001</year><volume>76</volume><fpage>722</fpage><lpage>726</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1097/00001888-200107000-00017</pub-id></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Slatt LM, Frasier PY, Strayhorn G, Kowlowitz V. Prevention practices of family medicine clerkship preceptors in North Carolina. Acad Med. 2001;76:722&#x02013;6. <pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11448830</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>